  "bodyHash": "4a3a546511fe1f3f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-smoker-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Smoker-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-furnace-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/more-smoker-variants/1.20.6/res/suggested-lolmfv.svg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/58vfg.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<h2>更多燻製爐變體</h2>\n<p>現在每個木材類型都有對應的燻製爐變體，甚至還包括其他基礎石材類型，分別是<strong>黑石<sup>1</sup></strong>與<strong>深板岩圓石<sup>1</sup></strong>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/zs1b9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>1</strong>：<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-furnace-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Furnace Variants</a></em>（更多熔爐變體）為所有版本（<em>1.21.4<sup><strong>2</strong></sup></em> 除外）中其他石材類型所必備。</p>\n<h3>黑石／深板岩燻製爐的特殊配方<sup>2</sup>：<br><sup>注意：此處僅適用於未安裝「更多熔爐變體」的版本。</sup><br><img src=\"https://i.catgirl.host/i/10wri.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br><sup>範例：緋紅黑石燻製爐</sup> <br>除了使用對應的熔爐變體外，您也可以使用一般熔爐，並將合成方格四個角落的剩餘槽位填入對應石材：黑石燻製爐填入黑石，深板岩燻製爐填入深板岩圓石。</h3>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>為 Minecraft 新增 32 種燻製爐變體！</h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方塊替換功能：</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/4tjpe.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>觀察草原村莊屠夫商店的後院：我們可以看到，遊戲現在會生成由<em><strong>金合歡木燻製爐</strong></em>與三根<em><strong>金合歡火把</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Torch Variants</a>）組成的村莊，而非原本的<em>橡木燻製爐</em>與三根<em>橡木火把</em>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/996sz.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>觀察沙漠村莊農場的屠夫商店內部：我們可以看到，遊戲現在會生成由<em><strong>叢林木燻製爐</strong></em>、<em><strong>叢林木堆肥桶</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-composter-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Composter Variants</a>）與<em><strong>叢林木火把</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Torch Variants</a>）組成的村莊，而非原本的<em>橡木燻製爐</em>、一般<em>堆肥桶</em>與<em>橡木火把</em>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
